@{
    Layout = null;
    ViewData["Title"] = "Đăng ký";
}
@*
    Man DANG KY cua co so dung bo man doi tac (Ung Buou) — hai buoc trong mot trang.

    Khuon lay NGUYEN VAN tu repo doi tac:
      DangKyOnlineUB/PhongMach/Views/HT_DangNhap/Register.cshtml (style 1-468, markup 560-764)
    Doi: logo, bo cuc mot cot, bo chieu cao 50vh, lien ket ve man Dang nhap,
    va khoi <script> goi API cua SixosPwa.

    Ma xac thuc do CHINH doi tac gui qua SMS (kenh 3) — benh nhan tu go, dung nhu
    tren trang cua ho. Doc ADR 0014 truoc khi sua.
*@

<!doctype html>
<html lang="vi">
<head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1, viewport-fit=cover" />
    <title>Đăng ký — @ViewBag.TenCoSo</title>

    <partial name="_PwaHead" />

    <link rel="stylesheet" href="~/lib/bootstrap/dist/css/bootstrap.min.css" />
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="~/css/site.css" asp-append-version="true" />
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="~/css/ub-tabler-bu.css" asp-append-version="true" />
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="~/css/show-toast.css" asp-append-version="true" />
    <script src="~/js/show-toast.js" asp-append-version="true"></script>
<style>

    html {
        overflow-x: hidden !important;
    }

    .auth-row {
        height: 100vh;
    }

    .mb-2,
    .mb-3 {
